    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that youre being cautious but i really cant afford a hospital bill right now. my throat feels fine as soon as i stop thinking about it, it's just a weird sensation. if i just take a really high dose of Benadryl, like 50mg or even 100mg at once, wouldn't that basically just knock out the allergic reaction and help me sleep through it? i just want to know if a big dose is safe enough to manage this at home so i dont have to go in.",
